Z||000003||rogergarrison||12-31-2001||04:17 PM||||They do know that the sail 'window' isnt really a window didnt they? Id have just took out a tire tool and broke out the rest while they watched. You have to put in a new one anyway. The whole sail panel/window is just to make it look from the side like a fastback, serves no useful purpose that should be an issue. I have no quarter window at all, just black plastic.||||reg||1
